# title: Ctrl+H replace — 替换 replaces one, 全部替换 replaces the rest
# checklist: C2
# engines: cm native
# timeout: 180
open:$V\find.md
uclick:~alpha beta
key:ctrl+home
key:ctrl+h
ms:900
type:Hello
ms:500
uia:C2.zh-replace-field|替换为@Edit
uia:C2.zh-replace-button|替换@Button
uia:C2.zh-replace-all-button|全部替换@Button
uclick:替换为@Edit
type:Howdy
ms:300
uclick:替换@Button
ms:600
shot:one
key:ctrl+s
ms:1500
set:afterOne|ReadV 'find.md'
expect:C2.replace-one-not-all|([regex]::Matches($vars.afterOne, 'Hello')).Count -ge 1
fileshow:find.md
uclick:全部替换@Button
ms:600
shot:all
key:ctrl+s
ms:1500
fileeq:C2.replace-all|find.md|# Find test\n\nalpha beta alpha gamma alpha\n\nHowdy one. Howdy two.\n
